   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Rate limit on tokens/min, not just requests\n\u2022 Stream tokens: TTFT is the SLO users feel\n\u2022 Route by load + KV prefix cache hit\n\u2022 Shed or queue, never silently degrade\n\u2022 Retries are not idempotent: tokens cost money\n\u2022 Same API across own + brokered GPUs",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Rate limit on tokens/min, not just requests\n\u2022 Stream tokens: TTFT is the SLO users feel\n\u2022 Route by load + KV prefix cache hit\n\u2022 Shed or queue, never silently degrade\n\u2022 Retries are not idempotent: tokens cost money\n\u2022 Same API across own + brokered GPUs",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "q1-inference-api-notes",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
